        <mxCell id="rNote" value="&lt;b&gt;Note&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;No file content passes through the object processor on retrieval. It returns a short-lived presigned URL and the caller fetches the object from S3 directly.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;/status/{correlationId} returns persisted callback validation outcomes, which is how a client distinguishes a rejected upload from one still in flight." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;spacingLeft=8;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#999999;dashed=1;" vertex="1" parent="r1">
